title: Use the Foreign Ministry
subtitle: Coordinate the EU, Hungary, the United States and Ukraine inside the cabinet mandate.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and foreign_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_foreign_ministry_line_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_foreign_ministry_line_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/presidential-channel.webp

= Use the Foreign Ministry

Lewica holds the diplomatic pen, not the whole state. The Prime Minister sets
the cabinet mandate; Defence, Finance, Parliament and the President retain
their own powers.

- @eu
- @us
- @ukraine
- @hungary

@eu
title: Put funds, democratic law and social investment into one EU brief
subtitle: The ministry can negotiate; domestic delivery remains a cabinet task.
on-arrival: eu_institutional_trust += 5; eu_influence += 4; eu_progressive_headwind -= 2; government_delivery += 2; foreign_ministry_override_risk += 2 if government_party != "lewica"; foreign_policy_responsibility += 3 if government_party = "lewica"; news_headline = "Foreign Affairs carries one transparent Polish brief into the EU"

One brief, one set of numbers, one delegation saying the same thing in the
Council as in the Sejm. Ministries that spent years running parallel European
policies discover that the pen now sits in a single office.

- #poland_card_finish

@us
title: Balance the White House with Congress and alliance institutions
subtitle: Keep Poland connected when the administration changes.
on-arrival: us_alliance_reliability += 4; us_congress_channel += 4; us_ambassador_channel += 2; foreign_ministry_override_risk += 2 if government_party != "lewica"; foreign_policy_responsibility += 3 if government_party = "lewica"; news_headline = "The ministry broadens the American relationship beyond one office"

An ambassador leaves, a president changes, and a relationship built on one
personal channel leaves with them. Congressional committees, NATO staffs and
the embassy's working level outlast an administration. That is the whole
argument.

- #poland_card_finish

@ukraine
title: Coordinate Ukraine support, accession and reconstruction
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Defence keeps operational command.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The initiative needs one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; ukraine_solidarity += 6; eu_influence += 3; government_delivery += 3; fiscal_stress += 1; foreign_ministry_override_risk += 2 if government_party != "lewica"; foreign_policy_responsibility += 4 if government_party = "lewica"; news_headline = "The ministry joins Ukraine support to accession and reconstruction"

Support, accession and reconstruction stop being three files run by three
directors who meet at Christmas. Defence keeps operational command; the
diplomatic half finally reads as one policy with a price attached.

- #poland_card_finish

@hungary
title: Keep Budapest businesslike and open to democratic change
subtitle: Work with the government in office without making Fidesz Poland's foreign-policy model.
on-arrival: hungary_relation += 4; hungary_democratic_network += 3; eu_institutional_trust += 2 if hungary_fidesz_in_power = 0; foreign_ministry_override_risk += 1 if government_party != "lewica"; foreign_policy_responsibility += 2 if government_party = "lewica"; news_headline = "Warsaw keeps a state channel to Budapest and a democratic channel beyond it"

Warsaw keeps talking to whoever governs Budapest and keeps talking to the
people who would rather it were somebody else. The distinction is easy to state
and needs defending roughly once a fortnight.

- #poland_card_finish
